# Copy this file to .env and fill it in. .env is gitignored, .env.example is not.
#
# The Web3Forms access key for the Mail window. Get one free at https://web3forms.com,
# it takes one email to confirm.
#
# PUBLIC_ is Astro's marker for "this is allowed to reach the browser". This key does
# reach the browser, and it is designed to: it is an alias for an inbox, not a password.
# Keeping it here rather than in the source keeps it out of git history and makes it one
# line to rotate. It does NOT make it secret, and nothing can, on a site with no server.
#
# When you deploy, set the same variable in the Cloudflare dashboard so the build there
# has it too. Without it the composer still works, it just falls back to showing the
# email address instead of sending.
PUBLIC_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
